      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The API log panel will appear at the bottom of a note (including in __TRILIUM_PH_0__Quick edit__TRILIUM_PH_1__) after executing a script that uses __TRILIUM_PH_2__. It can be dismissed temporarily by pressing the close button in the top-right of the panel.",
